    Bug 2002416 - Add x-moz-ews to MESSAGE_PROTOCOLS to allow running content scripts in EWS messages. r=mkmelin


    MessageDisplayScripts identify message browsers through the scheme of the
    loaded URI, which was not yet including the new x-moz-ews scheme for EWS
    messages.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D274765

